{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55407","headline":"卦歌 · 毛大仙","name":"卦歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水马爲妻壻，不久下泉乡。\n命里妨头妻，再得口天娘。\n（《新编分门古今类事》卷十六引《秘阁闲谈》。\n）（按：《秘阁闲谈》云：吴淑之妹丧夫後，再配于马淑。\n「初，马淑之先君在江南爲饶州副使，其前妻冯氏，方强壮之时，常使术士毛大仙者作卦歌。\n其中曾述配偶之事曰〖歌略〗。\n後冯卒，再娶吴氏。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛大仙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}